# No environment variables are required by this plugin repository at build or
# test time. Copying this file is optional.

# gmail is BYO-only (restricted scope). It performs NO relay first-party calls —
# the tenant's own OAuth client secret refreshes locally inside the daemon. The
# PUBLIC_BASE_URL / DAEMON_API_KEY env vars used by the google-sheets first-party
# path are NOT read by this plugin.
